This was my second ascension. The first was a wizard some time ago,
didnt post a YAFAP because this is my first post to usenet
altogether... Sorry for the not-so-good english...

I didn't take notes (I never do), so i'm writing this from memory.

Twoflower started weak and wimpy on lvl 1 with his pet dog Kiivi.
Headed to minetown first an found a magic lamp and a magic whistle
there. The temple was'nt co-aligned, so went back and continued down
the main dungeon until I found an altar on dlvl 4. Converted it and
made some HW. Also found a second magic lamp (!) there. Wished for
SDSM and a CoMR. Now that I think of it, the EoA would have been a lot
better choice...
Did sokoban, which, luckily, had a BoH. Did mine´s end too. After
that, continued down. Nothing fancy until I found the quest portal. I
was explvl. 14 so went in and noticed the name of my quest leader. Oh
well, the devteam has been reading Pratchett too. So I went down to
the quest. The shops there were useful, and somewhere around there, I
found a nifty pair of GoD and a magic marker. The Master of Thieves
went down relatively easy and i grabbed the PYEC
and charged up some nifty stuff: +5 RoID and the Marker.
I already had an AC of - ~30, so I headed down to the castle and
killed everything there easily because h,L and ; had been genocided
already. The Wand was (0:2) so I (probably) wished for: +3 SB, at
least 2 markers, a +oIdentify (essential to me!) and a /oPoly that got
me (finally) a =oSD.
Then I went back up and did a _huge_ sacfest on an altar in the hopes
of MagicBane, because I had dagger on Expert. All i got was the
Brands, Banes and Mojo. So i chose Mjollnir and a silver saber and
twoweaponed. Did some enchanting an the went to the valley. There I
surprisingly found a WoW (0:2) (!). With the wishes overload i got a
few markers, 7 candles, WoD (mojo blew up orcus's wand) and an AoLS
Gehennom was easy and boring, but luckily I knew the magic mapping
spell.
So, grabbed the amulet and ran. The Force was not too annoying: only
got thrown back a few times.
Off to the planes i went. The Wizard fell for a WoD and I used
confused ?oGD to find the portals. Planes were quite easy, even on air
with ~200 hp and AC-31 there was no need for my 4 !oFH. On astral i
wished for a rubber chicken and had to visit every temple there to
find the neutral altar. I had a HoOA, but I wanted to do it the right
way. Death drained from me a lot of HP, but i managed to run to the
right temple.

